abstract: >
  MouseScope is a modular desktop platform for practical mouse behavioral
  video analysis. Version 3.3.0 adds the Morris Water Maze (MWM) workflow while
  retaining the Project Workspace workflow, real video timebase handling, safer
  upload validation, runtime guards, and packaging metadata. It supports Tail
  Suspension Test (TST), Forced Swim Test (FST), Morris Water Maze (MWM), Open
  Field Test (OFT), Novel Object Recognition (NOR), Elevated Plus Maze (EPM),
  Y-Maze, and Light-Dark Box (LDB) with visual setup, batch review, result
  export, and bilingual reporting.
